1
00:00:00,493 --> 00:00:03,163
(Leonard:)...at the Topical Conference
on Bose-Einstein Condensates.

2
00:00:03,329 --> 00:00:06,329
(Sheldon:)I know. I read it before I threw it out.

3
00:00:06,499 --> 00:00:09,289
Okay, if I may drill down
to the bedrock of my question...

4
00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:10,750
...why did you throw it out?

5
00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:14,800
(Sheldon:)Because I have no interest in standing in
the Rose Room of the Pasadena Marriott...

6
00:00:14,966 --> 00:00:17,216
(Sheldon:)...in front of a group
of judgmental strangers...

7
00:00:17,385 --> 00:00:21,475
...who wouldn't recognize genius if it were
standing in front of them giving a speech.

8
00:00:21,639 --> 00:00:24,099
(Sheldon:)Which, if I were there, it would be.

9
00:00:24,809 --> 00:00:25,849
(Howard:)I don't know, Sheldon.

10
00:00:26,018 --> 00:00:29,818
Those Topical Conference on Bose-Einstein
Condensates parties are legendary.

11
00:00:29,981 --> 00:00:31,311
(Leonard:)Forget the parties.

12
00:00:31,482 --> 00:00:34,442
(Howard:)Forget the parties? What a nerd.

13
00:00:35,278 --> 00:00:37,858
Any other honors I've gotten
that I don't know about?

14
00:00:38,030 --> 00:00:40,990
(Leonard:)Did UPS drop off a Nobel Prize
with my name on it?

15
00:00:41,158 --> 00:00:44,658
Leonard, don't take this the wrong way,
but the day you win a Nobel Prize...

16
00:00:44,829 --> 00:00:49,459
(Sheldon:)...is the day I begin my research on the
drag coefficient of tassels on flying carpets.

17
00:00:50,126 --> 00:00:54,046
Ha, ha, ha. The only thing missing from
that insult was your mama.

18
00:00:54,964 --> 00:00:58,304
I got one. Hey, Leonard, your mama's
research methodology is so flawed...

19
00:00:58,467 --> 00:01:00,217
(Leonard:)Shut up, Howard.

